WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A pedestrian offers directions. The exchange feels continuous.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A door briefly interrupts the view between two people.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A different person resumes. The conversation goes on.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
About half noticed the switch in the 1998 field experiment.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
We do not always register every change in a real scene.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A report is a starting point. Check the record before believing.
